5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's day zero, we have no information yet.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,I'm so excited! I wonder who the big bad wolf is hiding among us?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I want to find the werewolf! It'll be like a real treasure hunt!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep a cool head. We should look for contradictions in our statements as the days progress.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Logical. I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, you seem very energetic. Is that just your personality, or are you trying to distract us?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Asuka! You're so serious. I'm just enjoying the game!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,May-san is always like that! It's fun!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,It's too early to judge based on personality alone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Agreed. Let's see who starts acting suspicious when the first death occurs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
