31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have information. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka, that's a lie! Why would you frame me so early?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Eh?! May-san is the wolf? That's a huge surprise!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Asuka is claiming to be the Seer. If she's telling the truth, the game ends today.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A bold claim. Asuka, are you really the Seer, or are you a werewolf trying to eliminate a rival?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I am the Seer. I divined May last night, and the result was werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,May,,"This is ridiculous! I'm just a villager! @Minako, you believe her over me?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,Maybe Asuka-san is just mistaken? Or maybe it's a trick!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"If Asuka is the Seer, her information is absolute. If she's the werewolf, she's bluffing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, you seem very eager to defend May. That's interesting.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I have no reason to lie. The most logical move for the village is to trust the Seer.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm not the werewolf! Please, don't vote for me!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,I just think we should be careful! We can't just believe one person!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"The risk of executing a villager is high, but the reward of catching the wolf is higher.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm inclined to believe Asuka. Her delivery is consistent with her personality.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
